{
    "title": "Tattoo Maker - Tattoo Design",
    "description": "The Tattoo Maker - Tattoo simulator app lets you try new tattoo designs, without any pain! Tattoo yourself on your own photos. Using our app you will feel like in a virtual tattooing saloon or photo booth machine. Just choose a pic from the gallery or take one using a camera, choose the inked tattoo design that fits your style, rotate, resize, save and share your effect! Let your friends think that you are really tattooed.\r\n  \r\n \u2714\ufe0f Fantastic app to design tattoo simulator\r\n\r\nOur editing tool contains many artistic tattoo ideas for women and men (for example: rose, dragon or tribal tattoos... and much more!).\r\n\r\nRemember, making ink in the real world is not a game, they will stay on your skin forever, so first check how it looks in our tattoo app. Also the studies have shown that tattooed women and men arouse more interest in others. But you can have this effect just from the photos, can't you? The result doesn't look like a fake tattoo, do not worry and try.\r\n\r\nYou can also add your own text tattoo. Choose a font, write your favorite text and you're done!\r\n\r\nNow you can add your own design from another photo. Just choose one from the gallery or search for some on the internet. This is a tattoo simulator.\r\n\r\n   \u2714\ufe0f Discover tattoo ideas and designs\r\n\r\nWhether you are a tattoo artist or a fan of tattoos, you will love this application, since it has almost 10 thousand tattoo ideas and every week we add new designs, styles, trends, news and many more things about the world of tattoos.\r\nWe carefully organized the application so that you can easily navigate through it and find the style and design of tattoos that you are looking for in the following categories:\r\n- Tattoo simulator\r\n- Tattoos for Men\r\n- Tattoos for women\r\n- Tattoos by Zones\r\n- Animal Tattoos\r\n- Tattoo trends and news\r\n\r\nDownload the Tattoo Maker - Tattoo simulator app now and enjoy thousands of ideas to inspire your next tattoos.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Tattoo Maker - Tattoo simulator app lets you try new tattoo designs, without any pain! Tattoo yourself on your own photos. Using our app you will feel like in a virtual tattooing saloon or photo booth machine. Just choose a pic from the gallery or take one using a camera, choose the inked tattoo design that fits your style, rotate, resize, save and share your effect! Let your friends think that you are really tattooed.<br>  <br> \u2714\ufe0f Fantastic app to design tattoo simulator<br><br>Our editing tool contains many artistic tattoo ideas for women and men (for example: rose, dragon or tribal tattoos... and much more!).<br><br>Remember, making ink in the real world is not a game, they will stay on your skin forever, so first check how it looks in our tattoo app. Also the studies have shown that tattooed women and men arouse more interest in others. But you can have this effect just from the photos, can&#39;t you? The result doesn&#39;t look like a fake tattoo, do not worry and try.<br><br>You can also add your own text tattoo. Choose a font, write your favorite text and you&#39;re done!<br><br>Now you can add your own design from another photo. Just choose one from the gallery or search for some on the internet. This is a tattoo simulator.<br><br>   \u2714\ufe0f Discover tattoo ideas and designs<br><br>Whether you are a tattoo artist or a fan of tattoos, you will love this application, since it has almost 10 thousand tattoo ideas and every week we add new designs, styles, trends, news and many more things about the world of tattoos.<br>We carefully organized the application so that you can easily navigate through it and find the style and design of tattoos that you are looking for in the following categories:<br>- Tattoo simulator<br>- Tattoos for Men<br>- Tattoos for women<br>- Tattoos by Zones<br>- Animal Tattoos<br>- Tattoo trends and news<br><br>Download the Tattoo Maker - Tattoo simulator app now and enjoy thousands of ideas to inspire your next tattoos.",
